Description: native Material 3 player for YouTube Music, local files and music servers
 Sung plays YouTube Music, imported audio files and a Navidrome, Subsonic or
 Jellyfin server through one Qt Quick interface, with synchronized lyrics, an
 immersive player, animated artwork and MPRIS desktop integration.
 .
 The QML modules this package depends on are listed by hand: they are loaded at
 runtime by name and no automatic dependency scanner can see them.
 .
 An isolated Python runtime for the YouTube resolver is bundled under
 /usr/lib/sung/runtime, because ytmusicapi is not packaged in Debian.
